==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[derived]] [[function]]}}

# {{context|calculus|lang=en}} Of a function, another function, the value of which for any value of the [[independent variable]] is the [[instantaneous]] [[rate of change]] of the given function at that value of the independent variable.

====Synonyms====
* [[derivative]]

